  "_doc": "What a question asks, by language: the words that mark an ask, and the words that name a quantity's kind (lowercase). The kind named nearest an ask word, in its sentence, is what the question asks; a translation must ask the same kind. A word that names more than one kind (Amharic ኃይል: force, energy or power) lists each. docs/MODEL_READER.md. \"unnamed\" is a word for a quantity that names no kind (\"amount\", \"كمية\", \"መጠን\"): an ask the tables cannot read.",
